            </div>

            <div class="info-img">
                <img src="images/profilee.png" alt="Profile Image">
            </div>
         </div>

            
        </div>
        
    <div class="services">
            <div class="list">
                <h2>My services</h2>
                <span>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. A officia saepe animi esse reprehenderit sint atque doloremque cupiditate numquam earum error temporibus, deleniti ipsum? Sequi hic molestias eius cupiditate perferendis!</span>
