            <span>Blog, E-Commerce</span>
            </div>
            <div class="boxx">
                <img src="icon/Icon_illustrating.svg" alt="">
                <h4>Mobile App Design</h4>
                <span>Character Design , Props & Objects</span>
            </div>
            </div>
            <div>
            <div class="boxx">
                <img src="icon/Microphone.svg" alt="">
