                <span>Portrait, Product Photography</span>
            </div>
            </div>
            <div>
            <div class="boxx">
                <img src="icon/Photographer.svg" alt="">
                <h4>Audio Editing</h4>
                <span>Sound Design, Mixing</span>
            </div>
            <div class="boxx">
                <h4>Advertising</h4>
